methods={'text_screen':'Every current Micro stem and choice was included in full-bank grammar, phrase, and repeated-family screening; candidate wording was then reviewed in context. This is not a new line-by-line answer-key or difficulty certification.','graph_review':'All 1,195 image-bearing stems and option sets were reviewed with the image and equivalent accessibility description mentally hidden. All 233 referenced image files were visually inspected; five are byte-identical copies, leaving 228 distinct image contents.','scope':'Canonical Composer Micro course-area membership resolved through the normal exporter read-only collection, answer-resolution and partition functions. No polished-game source banks were added.','shared_general':'All shared records were included in screening. No style finding or approved General wording/graph revision was reopened. Two concrete residual shortcuts affect shared records absent from both completed change lists.','repair_status':'Directions only, not replacement questions. The proposed construct and graph tests are acceptance criteria for later implementation, not claims that unwritten revisions have passed validation.'}
